[list]
[*]Colonists wearing a stand uniform now change back out of it while a threat is on the map. Before this, any threat froze shift changes in both directions, so anyone already in uniform stayed in it.
[*]Changing INTO a uniform is still blocked while there is a threat, which is the half worth keeping. Nobody should walk across the base to put on whites in the middle of a firefight.
[*]Nothing reacts to a raid arriving. A raid does not send anyone to a stand and it does not pull anyone out of one. Colonists change back on their own next job, the way they always have, and the Change back button is still there for when you want it now rather than then. Drafted colonists, right-click orders and emergency work are untouched, as before.
[/list]
